      "name": "The Bogey Club",
      "description": "Golf simulator sports bar in Newmarket, Ontario, serving Newmarket, Aurora, East Gwillimbury, Bradford and York Region. Four Golfzon golf simulators (two TwoVision NX and two Vision Plus): two bar-side bays staffed daily 9 AM to 12 AM and two automated bays bookable and playable 24/7. Fully licensed with two full bars, draft beer and cocktails, plus karaoke, golf leagues, private lessons and an upstairs private event space for birthdays and corporate events.",
